# Two influences on one body armour: an Awakener's Orb merge.
#
# The receiver is rolled while Magic, with alterations, until its one influence
# mod is the Redeemer aura effect; a Redeemer's Exalted Orb would add the
# influence to a plain base first. An Awakener's Orb then destroys a Hunter
# donor and reforges the receiver with both influences, keeping one influence
# mod from each side. Which influence mods survive is not promised, so the
# finish is only a bench life roll when there is room for it.

item {
    base:       "Vaal Regalia"
    ilvl:       86
    rarity:     normal
    influences: redeemer
}

transmute
until has "increased effect of non-curse auras" t1 and prefixCount == 0 {
    alteration
}
regal
awakener hunter

if prefixCount <= 2 and not has "maximum life" {
    bench "maximum life"
}
